00:20:53,897 --> 00:24:35,146
Mira: Do you think I'm a robot? Of course I have free time! In the evenings I usually walk around the streets, watching Saigon at night. Sometimes I... oh, never mind. What about your hàng ngày routine? I bet it's very free-spirited like Americans, right?

